{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 12, "ref": "judges 14:12", "book": "judges", "lang": "nl", "chapter": 14, "translation": "En Simson zei tot hen: Laat ⟨את⟩ mij toch een raadsel bij jullie opwerpen. Als jullie het mij verkondigen, ja verklaren, binnen de zeven dagen van het feestmaal, en ⟨jullie⟩ het vinden, dan geef ik jullie dertig linnen gewaden en dertig stel kleren.", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "en hij zei"}, {"surface": "להם", "gloss": "tot hen"}, {"surface": "שמשון", "gloss": "Simson"}, {"surface": "אחודה", "gloss": "laat mij een raadsel opwerpen"}, {"surface": "נא", "gloss": "toch"}, {"surface": "לכם", "gloss": "bij jullie"}, {"surface": "חידה", "gloss": "een raadsel"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "als"}, {"surface": "הגד", "gloss": "verkondigen"}, {"surface": "תגידו", "gloss": "jullie verklaren"}, {"surface": "אותה", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "het (het raadsel)"}, {"surface": "לי", "gloss": "mij"}, {"surface": "שבעת", "gloss": "binnen de zeven"}, {"surface": "ימי", "gloss": "dagen"}, {"surface": "המשתה", "gloss": "van het feestmaal"}, {"surface": "ומצאתם", "gloss": "en jullie vinden"}, {"surface": "ונתתי", "gloss": "dan geef ik"}, {"surface": "לכם", "gloss": "jullie"}, {"surface": "שלשים", "gloss": "dertig"}, {"surface": "סדינים", "gloss": "linnen gewaden"}, {"surface": "ושלשים", "gloss": "en dertig"}, {"surface": "חלפת", "gloss": "stel"}, {"surface": "בגדים", "gloss": "kleren"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:38:35.314721437Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}